---
import Logo from "../components/Logo.astro";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <title>QNTX · SVG Logo 可行性检查</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <a href="/">QuantX</a>
      <span>PHASE 0 / LOGO REVIEW</span>
    </header>
    <main>
      <p class="eyebrow">阶段 0 已复核通过 · 阶段 1 已接入独立预览</p>
      <h1>
        修复完成。
        <br />
        现在，回到网络之中。
      </h1>
      <p class="lead">
        原始 SVG 的路径与边界问题已修复。Overview 现已区分区域睁眼与 Logo
        悬停待机，点击后显示无嘴笑眼，说明在节点旁丝滑弹出。
      </p>
      <p>
        <a class="preview-link" href="/">
          打开 Overview 交互预览 ↗
        </a>
      </p>
      <div class="comparison">
        <section class="sample before">
          <div class="sample-heading">
            <h2>原始版本</h2>
            <span>初始渲染</span>
          </div>
          <div class="logo-area">
            <img
              src="/logo-check/before.png"
              width="220"
              height="220"
              alt="原始 SVG 因路径错误只显示三角残片"
            />
          </div>
          <p>圆弧缺少一个半径参数，浏览器报错；悬停结束后才被脚本写回正确轮廓。</p>
        </section>
        <section class="sample after">
          <div class="sample-heading">
            <h2>修复预览</h2>
            <span>悬停或 Tab 聚焦</span>
          </div>
          <div class="logo-area">
            <Logo size={168} label="修复后的 QNTX 动画 Logo，悬停或键盘聚焦查看" />
          </div>
          <p>保留原轮廓与原动画的表情几何，平滑进入、循环与返回；动画始终留在 SVG 画布内。</p>
        </section>
      </div>
      <section class="sizes">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">目标尺寸与实例隔离</p>
          <h2>小尺寸也保持完整。</h2>
          <p>两个独立实例不会互相触发。开启系统“减少动态效果”时显示完整静态标识。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="size-sample">
          <Logo size={80} label="80 像素 QNTX 动画 Logo" />
          <span>80px / 现有中央标识尺寸</span>
        </div>
        <div class="size-sample">
          <Logo size={48} label="48 像素 QNTX 动画 Logo" />
          <span>48px / 小尺寸检查</span>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="assessment">
        <h2>阶段 0 的结论</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>
            <strong>修复后替换：复核通过。</strong>
            补全路径、统一边界并隔离实例后，已按原中央标识尺寸接入；未改变外层面板高度。
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>节点交互：通过并已实现。</strong>
            使用原生按钮和局部事件处理，点击在节点附近弹出说明；淡出后再切换位置，无新增组件依赖。
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>小方块跟随：通过并已实现。</strong>
            仅内部方块及表情眼部在有限范围内偏移，移出右侧区域归中；外层 Logo 不跟随鼠标移动。
          </li>
        </ol>
        <p>
          上方保留上一轮 Logo 修复对比。本轮接入仍使用原动画的轮廓与表情几何，没有采用 Stitch
          示例中的固定大高度或向视口外弹出的浮层。
        </p>
      </section>
      <footer>
        独立预览 · 原网站与原 Logo 目录均未覆盖 · <a href="/">查看交互 Overview ↗</a>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    color: #20231e;
    background: #f7f7f4;
    font-family: "Segoe UI", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
  }
  :global(a) {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 28px 6vw;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #daddd3;
  }
  header a {
    font-size: 23px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  header span {
    color: #596250;
    font: 11px monospace;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  main {
    max-width: 1240px;
    width: 88%;
    margin: auto;
    padding-top: 64px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    color: #596250;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 54px);
    font-weight: 450;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -1.5px;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }
  .lead {
    max-width: 700px;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: #596250;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .preview-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    padding-bottom: 5px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 21px;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .comparison {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 28px;
  }
  .sample {
    padding: 28px;
    border: 1px solid #daddd3;
  }
  .sample-heading {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .sample-heading span {
    color: #596250;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .logo-area {
    height: 270px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    color: #18181b;
  }
  .logo-area img {
    display: block;
    width: 220px;
    height: 220px;
  }
  .sample p,
  .sizes p,
  .assessment p,
  .assessment li {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: #596250;
  }
  .sample p {
    max-width: 440px;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .sizes {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 40px;
    margin-top: 48px;
    padding: 40px 0;
    border-block: 1px solid #daddd3;
  }
  .sizes p {
    max-width: 390px;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .sizes .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .size-sample {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
    color: #18181b;
  }
  .size-sample span {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #596250;
  }
  .assessment {
    max-width: 900px;
    padding: 48px 0;
  }
  ol {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin: 28px 0;
  }
  li {
    padding-left: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  strong {
    color: #30372b;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  footer {
    border-top: 1px solid #daddd3;
    padding: 28px 0 50px;
    color: #596250;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }
  footer a {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    header {
      padding-block: 22px;
    }
    header span {
      font-size: 9px;
    }
    main {
      padding-top: 42px;
    }
    .comparison,
    .sizes {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .sample {
      padding: 22px;
    }
    .sample-heading {
      align-items: start;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .logo-area {
      height: 240px;
    }
    .sizes {
      gap: 36px;
    }
  }
</style>
